    "title": "Ex-Gov Youngkin Cashes In With Tysons Defense-Tech Power Player - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Kasandra Rattle ,\n7 hours ago Former Virginia governor Glenn Youngkin is sliding back into the private-sector spotlight, signing on with Tysons-based investment and incubation outfit Red Cell Partners. The move drops the onetime private-equity executive squarely back into Northern Virginia’s startup and defense-tech scene and marks his first major business role since leaving office earlier this year. Read full article\n2",
